    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Rule of inversion with connectors",
     "texto": [
      "When placed in first syntactic position, these connecting adverbs require immediate inversion of subject and verb (the conjugated verb takes position 2): **Danach rufe ich im Hotel an**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Chronological structure of a text",
     "texto": [
      "Start the message with the starting point (**Zuerst packe ich meinen Koffer**), continue with the intermediate steps (**Dann fahre ich zum Bahnhof**, **Danach kaufe ich das Ticket**) and conclude the action (**Schließlich komme ich am Ziel an**)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
